# Every window goes through ~/.local/bin/tmux-work: it joins the shared `work`
# tmux server or, for the first window after a boot, starts it, restores the
# last tmux-resurrect snapshot and arms autosave before attaching. The launcher
# also cd's to ~ first (a deleted cwd inherited by the server breaks new panes).
command = shell:/bin/zsh -l -c 'exec ~/.local/bin/tmux-work'
